message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AI Companion Time Anchor"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight local Codex temporal-awareness plugin that combines a
  per-conversation ambient time hook, an active clock reader, and a thin
  Temporal Cortex. The Temporal Cortex exposes compact derived temporal facts
  and places an immediate cognitive-update cue beside a successful active
  clock check so verified time can update the agent's understanding before
  language is produced. Local state contains timestamp/session-derived data
  only. Created at See Sol Lab through collaboration between Goumang and Sol;
  product concept and research direction by Goumang × Sol, implementation by
  Sol.
